{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## First `make verify` was contended, not red — external gate-slot holders\n\n`make verify` returned **2** (`12 failed, 19873 passed, 80 skipped in 4175.21s`). None of the\n12 is attributable to this change, and all 12 have one external cause.\n\nNine failed with `GateCongestedError: gate admission refused: all 4 concurrent gate slot(s)\non this host are ...`, and the other three (`test_plan_review_cli_retry`) with `assert 11 == 2`\n— a retry-count knock-on of the same refusal:\n\n```\ntest_eval_solver.py::test_completion_verifier_case_runs_and_scores\ntest_opcert_producer_seam_8d8e.py::test_orchestrator_degrade_key_unregenerable_records_unsigned\ntest_opcert_producer_seam_8d8e.py::test_orchestrator_degrade_ssh_keygen_unavailable_records_unsigned\ntest_pinned_ticket_view.py::test_verify_completion_reuses_an_owned_ticket_session_without_recapture_or_close\ntest_pinned_ticket_view.py::test_verify_completion_threads_one_pinned_view_through_library_and_agent_reads\ntest_plan_relation_snapshot.py::test_review_plan_preflight_tolerates_unrelated_untracked_tracker_files\ntest_plan_review_cli_retry.py::{test_cli_retry_is_compatible_with_no_sign,\n                                test_cli_retry_refuses_unreviewed_ticket_with_zero_calls,\n                                test_cli_retry_resumes_and_persists_lineage}\nworkflow/test_gate_error_sidecar.py::test_plan_review_outage_writes_gate_error_and_still_degrades\nworkflow/test_gate_error_sidecar_heldout.py::{test_existing_verdict_readers_skip_gate_error_record,\n                                              test_gate_error_verdict_not_coerced_to_fail}\n```\n\n**Direct evidence of the cause, not an inference.** `rebar.llm.gate_admission.gate_admission`\nholds one of `max_concurrent_gates` flock'd slot files that are HOST-WIDE, and a process list\ntaken during triage found three live gate runs from a DIFFERENT checkout\n(`/Users/joeoakhart/comment-gates-current`) holding them:\n\n```\n2238   .venv/bin/rebar review-plan autositic-scarlet-clam --output json\n44353  .venv/bin/rebar review-plan congenial-cibophobic-goosefish --output json\n66047  .venv/bin/rebar review-plan aberrant-scabrous-esok --output json\n```\n\nThree of the host's four slots were held by another session, leaving one for four xdist\nworkers. Slots are released from a `finally` and by flock-on-process-death, so nothing had\nleaked — the holders were live. Left running; they are another session's work.\n\nRe-running the affected modules with the change applied: **33 passed** in 261s. The run also\ntook 1:09:35 against AGENTS.md's documented 20-25 min, which independently confirms the host\nwas saturated.\n\nThis is contention on an LLM gate semaphore, orthogonal to a `git config` ordering change at\nstore init — this change cannot reach it. Not treated as a pass: a clean `make verify` is\nre-running and its verdict will be recorded here. The change is pushed as Gerrit **2721**,\nwhere CI runs on uncontended Linux runners.\n"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788662872421627567,"uuid":"3bb6689d-92e9-4b85-920a-0fd68fcfa578"}